{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11/13～12/25まで\nみなとみらいに私の大好きな\nトイストーリーのツリーが\nあるらしいよヾ(◜▿‾ ( ´▿｀ ) ‾▿◝)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人で行こーかなあー...。\n深川さん誘ったら\n一緒に来てくれるかな？♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！深川さんと言えば\n今度の全握深川さんとです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいみんの皆さん\nよろしくお願い致します(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天観ていただけましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理サークル発足しました(･д･)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理はよくするけど\n得意じゃないです(笑)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人参の皮剥きとかキャベツ千切りとか\nピーラー、スライサー使うから\n包丁使いうまく行きません！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録中まいちゅんと喧嘩してるけど\n仲良しだから安心してください！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにケーキの作業風景が\nあんまり無かったんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキのプレートは女子力の高い\nまいちゅん優里さんが\n作ってたよ！完成度高過ぎ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ観てない方は観てね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちやん、最近？\nブログで質問返ししないよね...\nもうしなくなっちゃったのー？\n(´｡･-･｡｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとだ(๑°︿°๑)\n無意識ですごめんなさい(๑°︿°๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し楽しくて好きだよー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん↑ちゃんはカフェ好き⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー。カフェより\n吉野家とかすき家とかのが\n行くかな！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんのウエディングドレスが観たかったなぁ\n本番では何色のドレスが着てみたい？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"式では白で、\n披露宴では着物をリメイクして\n自分でドレス作りたいなあって♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ私結婚願望が......。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば前の街ブラの時の"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票結果はどうなったのかな？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/29/9337422/